ADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT
----------------------------------
Redistributions (modified or unmodified) of AI Agents Rogue must retain clear
credit to Rogue Development and a link to https://github.com/rogue-dev-studio
in README.md, AGENTS.md, and NOTICE. Removing, renaming, hiding, or replacing
the author attribution is not permitted under this project's distribution terms.

PERMITTED USE (GITHUB ENTITLEMENT)
----------------------------------
Use and installation of AI Agents Rogue is permitted only for GitHub users who
have BOTH:
  (1) starred the official repository, and
  (2) forked the official repository
at https://github.com/rogue-dev-studio/ai-agents-rogue

Downloading a ZIP / copying files without a fork and star does not grant a
license to install or use this catalog. Installers verify entitlement via the
GitHub API (see GITHUB_ENTITLEMENT.json and scripts/check-github-entitlement.ps1).
Maintainer allowlist accounts are exempt as listed in GITHUB_ENTITLEMENT.json.
